# What a `vercel deploy` from this folder leaves behind. The project builds festfinder-backend,
# which also ships festfinder-frontend (/ops and the ui/ files it serves); node_modules, .git
# and .next are skipped by the CLI already.

# Laptop-only: local secrets and the test databases.
**/.env
**/.data
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Not part of this deployment.
festfinder-web
design_handoff_festfinder
# The full icon fonts and the script that cuts them; the cut lives in ui/vendor/phosphor.
festfinder-frontend/vendor-src
festfinder-frontend/scripts
